'' 'extern byref ri as integer' declares the alias; the 'dim shared byref ri ... = i' that defines it
'' binds it (fbc's dim/byref2.bas). tiko declined the declaration. Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/extern-byref.bas -o tests/codegen/externbyref.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/externbyref.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: -1             -1            11223344      55667788
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  5
